OL,3,GNEWSACultural shift needed to tackle
OL,4,Asmartphone harms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe entire community needs to get
OL,7,Finvolved if moves to minimise
OL,8,Fchildren's use of smartphones are to be
OL,9,Fa success, a senior Guernsey politician
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FEducation President Paul Montague said:
OL,13,F"Society needs to get behind our
OL,14,Fschools. It's a very simple rule. Our
OL,15,Faim for all our schools is they are
OL,16,Fcompletely smartphone free areas."
OL,18,FMontague said there was increasing
OL,19,Fevidence of the impact of smartphones
OL,20,Fon children's development. Wayne Bates
OL,21,Ffrom the teaching union NASUWT said he
OL,22,Fagreed with the need for change.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
