OL,3,GNEWSACultural shift needed to tackle
OL,4,Asmartphone harms
OL,5,
OL,6,FTelecoms provider Sure said it has seen
OL,7,Fsales of "brick phones" - phones that
OL,8,Fhave limited or not data so they can
OL,9,Fonly make calls or texts - go up by
OL,10,Falmost half year-on-year.
